  × DROP INDEX CONCURRENTLY cannot run inside a transaction block.
  
  i Run DROP INDEX CONCURRENTLY outside of a transaction block, e.g. in a migration of its own that runs without a transaction.
  
  i Migration tools usually run each migration in a transaction, so we assume that the file runs in one.
  


